[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SIP001
TITLE: Install one release on n airport computers and point them at the TOML file
STATEMENT: >>>
Installation shall place the same Tower release on each of the n computers for one airport and shall point every computer at that airport TOML file. The installer shall not start control until the file passes the configuration check. Acceptance is a procedure a support engineer can follow for n equal to 1 and for n equal to 3, with a bad file leaving the computers stopped.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Installation is per airport and uses the same file the requirements already constrain.
<<<
DAL: D
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: Plan
VERIFICATION: Review
ASSUMPTIONS: No separate computer-center install is required.
